[{"answer":"Hi Alex. It's Martha Clines here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/1.mp3"},{"answer":"James White gave me your number.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I hope you don't mind me calling you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Of course not. How are you, Martha?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Good thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/5.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm ringing because I need a bit of advice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh yeah. What about?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/7.mp3"},{"answer":"The training you did at JPNW a few years ago.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/8.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm applying for the same thing.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/9.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh right. Yes, I did mine in 2014.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Best thing I ever did. I'm still working there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/11.mp3"},{"answer":"Really? What are you doing?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, now I work in the customer services department","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/13.mp3"},{"answer":"but I did my initial training in Finance.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/14.mp3"},{"answer":"I stayed there for the first two years and then moved to where I am now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/15.mp3"},{"answer":"That's the same department I'm applying for.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you enjoy it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/17.mp3"},{"answer":"Ah... I was pretty nervous to begin with.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/18.mp3"},{"answer":"I didn't do well in my exams at school","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/19.mp3"},{"answer":"and I was really worried because I failed Maths.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/20.mp3"},{"answer":"But it didn't actually matter because I did lots of courses on the job.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/21.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you get a diploma at the end of your trainee period?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/22.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm hoping to do the one in business skills.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes. That sounds good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I took the one on IT skills but I wish I'd done that one instead.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/25.mp3"},{"answer":"OK, that's good to know.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/26.mp3"},{"answer":"What about the other trainees?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/27.mp3"},{"answer":"How did you get on with them?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/28.mp3"},{"answer":"There were about 20 of us who started at the same time","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/29.mp3"},{"answer":"and we were all around the same age.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I was 18 and there was only one person younger than me, who was 17.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/31.mp3"},{"answer":"The rest were between 18 and 20.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/32.mp3"},{"answer":"I made some good friends.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/33.mp3"},{"answer":"I've heard lots of good things about the training at JPNW.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/34.mp3"},{"answer":"It seems like there are a lot of opportunities there.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/35.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, definitely.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Because of its size you can work in loads of different areas within the organisation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/37.mp3"},{"answer":"What about pay?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/38.mp3"},{"answer":"I know you get a lower minimum wage than regular employees.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/39.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right - which isn't great.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/40.mp3"},{"answer":"But you get the same number of days' holiday as everyone else.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/41.mp3"},{"answer":"And the pay goes up massively if they offer you a job at the end of the training period.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, but I'm not doing it for the money.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/43.mp3"},{"answer":"It's the experience I think will be really useful.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/44.mp3"},{"answer":"Everyone says by the end of the year you gain so much confidence.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/45.mp3"},{"answer":"You're right. That's the most useful part about it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/46.mp3"},{"answer":"There's a lot of variety too.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/47.mp3"},{"answer":"You're given lots of different things to do.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/48.mp3"},{"answer":"I enjoyed it all - I didn't even mind the studying.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Do you have to spend any time in college?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, one day each month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/51.mp3"},{"answer":"So you get lots of support from both your tutor and your manager.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/52.mp3"},{"answer":"That's good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/53.mp3"},{"answer":"And the company is easy to get to, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's very close to the train station so the location's a real advantage.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Have you got a date for your interview yet?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/56.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, it's on the 23rd of this month.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/57.mp3"},{"answer":"So long as you're well prepared there's nothing to worry about.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Everyone's very friendly.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/59.mp3"},{"answer":"I am not sure what I should wear.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/60.mp3"},{"answer":"What do you think?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Nothing too casual - like jeans, for example.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/62.mp3"},{"answer":"If you've got a nice jacket, wear that with a skirt or trousers.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/63.mp3"},{"answer":"OK. Thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/64.mp3"},{"answer":"Any other tips?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/65.mp3"},{"answer":"Erm, well I know it's really obvious but arrive in plenty of time.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/66.mp3"},{"answer":"They hate people who are late.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/67.mp3"},{"answer":"So make sure you know exactly where you have to get to.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/68.mp3"},{"answer":"And one other useful piece of advice my manager told me before I had the interview for this job - is to smile.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/69.mp3"},{"answer":"Even if you feel terrified.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/70.mp3"},{"answer":"It makes people respond better to you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/71.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll have to practise doing that in the mirror!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/72.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah - well, good luck.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/73.mp3"},{"answer":"Let me know if you need any more information.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/74.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks very much.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-13-test-4-part-1-2023-03-25-05-28-08/75.mp3"}]
